1	//! Budgeted offline staging behind the [`StagingStore`] seam (blueprint/
2	//! engine.md "Sync core: Ops"; #33 D6).
3	//!
4	//! Web reaches full offline parity: uploads stage into OPFS/IndexedDB behind
5	//! the profile budget; **past the budget only new uploads fail fast, while
6	//! metadata ops queue unbounded**. The op queue is the durable divergence and
7	//! must never be capped — a delete or rename can always be journaled — but
8	//! staged upload *bytes* are bounded so an offline device cannot exhaust host
9	//! storage.
