1	//! Fixed-size chunk framing over core's content-seal (blueprint/engine.md
2	//! "Content plane": "the engine frames content into fixed-size chunks, seals
3	//! each with core's content-seal primitive ... fresh random per-version content
4	//! key").
5	//!
6	//! Framing is the engine's job; the seal and the leaf content-address are
7	//! core's ([`cipherbox_core::content`], #691). This module owns only the
8	//! split-into-fixed-chunks decision and the per-chunk nonce draw from injected
9	//! entropy — no crypto of its own (AGENTS.md rule 4).
